      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sorry, I largely haven't been thinking about impostors since I've been building my own Android (and later iOS) native versions of my avatars instead of relying on impostors.\n\nThe status update today reminded me of this feedback post, thanks for that.\n\nI just tested it and only observed usual impostor jank caused by viewing angle mismatch, and not limb duplication. Attached is a screenshot of a similar avatar in a similar orientation. (I don't think I have the avatar project for the original avatar I was testing on anymore, and while I likely had future proof publish turned on, I am not aware of any current way to re-download the unitypackage that feature uploads.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
